    "decided_proposition": "FKS2Pair.Old.scaledOutput = FKS2Pair.Old.scale * FKS2Pair.Old.sumOut ∧\n  FKS2Scalar.round64 (FKS2Pair.Old.scaledOutput + FKS2Pair.Old.anchorUpper) = some FKS2Pair.Old.anchorOutput ∧\n    FKS2Scalar.round64 (FKS2Pair.Old.anchorOutput + FKS2Pair.Old.pointUpper) = some FKS2Pair.Old.pointOutput ∧\n      FKS2Scalar.round64 (FKS2Pair.Old.pointOutput + FKS2Pair.Old.tailUpper) = some FKS2Pair.Old.out ∧\n        FKS2Table4.additionCheck (FKS2Pair.Old.scaledOutput + FKS2Pair.Old.anchorUpper) FKS2Pair.Old.anchorOutput =\n            true ∧\n          FKS2Table4.additionCheck (FKS2Pair.Old.anchorOutput + FKS2Pair.Old.pointUpper) FKS2Pair.Old.pointOutput =\n              true ∧\n            FKS2Table4.additionCheck (FKS2Pair.Old.pointOutput + FKS2Pair.Old.tailUpper) FKS2Pair.Old.out = true ∧\n              |FKS2Pair.Old.anchorOutput - (FKS2Pair.Old.scaledOutput + FKS2Pair.Old.anchorUpper)| ≤ 1 / 10 ^ 27 ∧\n                |FKS2Pair.Old.pointOutput - (FKS2Pair.Old.anchorOutput + FKS2Pair.Old.pointUpper)| ≤ 1 / 10 ^ 27 ∧\n                  |FKS2Pair.Old.out - (FKS2Pair.Old.pointOutput + FKS2Pair.Old.tailUpper)| ≤ 1 / 10 ^ 27",
